# Safe Engineering
- Never expose secrets.
- Never delete large directories or rewrite history.
- Do not modify lockfiles unless dependencies actually change.
- Run available lint, typecheck, test, and build commands.
- If a check cannot run, state the exact reason in `docs/VROO_PROJECT_STATE.md`.
- Keep each PR focused on one coherent task.
